  "text": "It's great that you want to make your mom a wonderful breakfast in bed! Making an omelette is a classic choice, and it's a great way to show your appreciation. Here's a basic recipe for a classic breakfast omelette:\n\n**Ingredients for the Omelette**\n\n- 2 eggs\n- 1 tablespoon of milk or water\n- Salt and black pepper to taste\n- Olive oil or butter for cooking\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. **Crack the eggs into a mixing bowl.**\n   - Add the milk or water, then beat the eggs with a fork until well mixed.\n   - Season with salt and black pepper.\n\n2. **Heat a nonstick skillet over medium heat.**\n   - Add a small amount of oil or butter and let it heat.\n\n3. **Pour the egg mixture into the heated skillet.**\n   - Cook the omelette until the eggs are just set, about 2-3 minutes.\n\n4. **Once the omelette is done, flip it and cook for another 1-2 minutes.**\n\n5. **Serve the omelette.**\n\nYou could make it more special by adding fresh cheese, herbs, or a drizzle of olive oil. Let me know what additions you prefer.",
